<title>USA: Eastman Kodak launches new photo scanner.</title>
<headline>Eastman Kodak launches new photo scanner.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Kodak Co on Monday began selling a new color photo print scanner for PCs at an opening retail price of $199.</p>
<p>The Kodak Snapshot Photo Scanner 1 can scan and display photos in less than 30 seconds, the company said.</p>
<p>It weights a little less than two pounds. It can be used with IBM compatible computers with 8 MB or more of available RAM, and equipped with a CD-ROM drive, and either Windows 3.1 or Windows 95 software.</p>
</text>
